WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.200
Applications Ledger — synthetic demonstration.

00:04.200 --> 00:18.000
Live contracts are listed with status, search and a route into each project ledger.

00:18.000 --> 00:40.000
A contract ledger keeps application, certification, payment and retention in one controlled grid.

00:40.000 --> 01:05.000
Certified measured works are entered. Retention, period and cumulative values are recomputed before save.

01:05.000 --> 01:28.000
The quantity surveyor dashboard lists due applications, certificates, retention releases and variance checks.

01:28.000 --> 01:50.000
A finance view shows an attention queue for certificates, cash and retention, and forecast hygiene.

01:50.000 --> 02:10.700
Application forecast controls show missing or stale forecasts across the portfolio.
